    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>Serviceform provides software and tools for global clients and customers, particularly chatbot and form builder software.</p>\n",
        "faq": "\n<dt id=\"where%20can%20i%20get%20the%20pixel%20id%3F\">\nWhere can I get the pixel ID?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>You have to sign-up at serviceform.com and enter your website details in order to get the Pixel ID. It will be displayed once you click continue after entering the website URL.<br />\nIf you need our help, please visit (https://serviceform.com/contact)</p>\n</p>\n\n",
